<p>Use this dialog box to specify the details of the background numbering 
 for confidential documents, for example.<br/>
An individual watermark number is printed on each copy. Recording the number 
 to be distributed among other users can prevent unauthorized copies.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="image" role="heading">Background Numbering Print Image</p>
<p>Displays an image of the background numbering print.</p>
<p class="Note">Note:</p>
<ul>
<li><p>The displayed image may differ from actual prints.</p></li>
</ul>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="size" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Size:</span></p>
<p>Select the size for the background numbering text.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="density" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Density:</span></p>
<p>Select the density for the background numbering text.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="color" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Color:</span></p>
<p>Select the color for the background numbering text.</p>
<p class="Note">Note:</p>
<ul>
<li><p>This function is available only for color printers.</p></li>
</ul>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="number" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Start Number:</span></p>
<p>Enter the start number for numbering.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="ok" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">OK</span></p>
<p>Saves the changes and closes the dialog box.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="cancel" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Cancel</span></p>
<p>Closes the dialog box without saving any changes.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="default" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Restore Defaults</span></p>
<p>Restores the settings on this dialog box to the default settings.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="help" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Help</span></p>
<p>Displays Help for the dialog box opened.</p>
